    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74018" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνειος</span></b>  (B), 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνήϊος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνίνημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>useful,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				627
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνια</span>)
			:—written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνιος</span></b> 
			in Tz.ad <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				621
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> : 
				Ion.
			
			
				Sup.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνήϊστος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
					<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> prob. in
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Flat.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, v.
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Hermes</u>
				46.274
			</span></i>), <i>most useful, serviceable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anaxag.
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pythag.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				8.49
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Iamb.</u>
				1.132
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				200
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Heraclit.
				121
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				Phoen.
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>, etc. ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνήϊστον
			πονέεσθαι</span> exert yourselves <i>to the utmost,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i> R.<i><span class="en">
				2.335
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδρωπος ὀνήϊστα</span>
			<i>the most effectual remedy</i> for the dropsy, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>.</div>
